{%- comment -%}
  =====================================================================
  BYMAN CYKLER - SNIPPET 3 OF 3: BRAND GRID (only if Logo list can't do it)
  =====================================================================
  WHERE IT GOES
    Password page, right under the "Mærker vi forhandler" Rich text section.
    Add section -> Custom liquid -> paste ALL of this file into the
    "Custom Liquid" box. Leave Subheading, Heading and Text empty.

  BEFORE YOU PASTE
    Upload the logo files to Content -> Files (Indhold -> Filer), from
    placeholder/assets/logos/ on your Mac:
      enve.png  specialized.svg  silca.svg  met.svg  polymer.svg
      gripgrab-original.png  dt-swiss.svg
    The file names in the list below must match the names in Files exactly.

  THE ONLY LINES YOU NORMALLY CHANGE: the brand list just below.
    One line per brand, in the order they should appear:
      Name | file name in Content -> Files | size
    "size" is the same number as "scale" in data/brands.json (1 = normal,
    bigger = bigger). Square badges like MET get scale x 1.2 here
    (1.4 x 1.2 = 1.68), which the standalone page does by itself.
    The "…og mange flere" box always comes last and fills the last row.
    From 12 brands the grid switches to 6 per row on wide screens.

  IF THE LOGOS DON'T SHOW (empty white boxes)
    Change  data-logos="red"  to  data-logos="black"  further down. The
    logos are then shown as plain black images (black is allowed by the
    logo rule). Also check that the file names match.

  HOW THE COLOUR WORKS
    Each logo file is used as a stencil ("CSS mask") and filled with the
    theme's text colour (Press red), like the standalone page. Shopify's
    file server allows this (checked on other Shopify stores' files on
    2026-10-09). Copied from build/index.html + build/styles.css
    (ui-spec.md section 5). Theme variables were seen on the Press demo
    (theme 5.0.0), not yet in your theme files; the value after each
    comma is used if a variable doesn't exist.
  Comments like this one are not sent to visitors.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture bc_brands -%}
ENVE             | enve.png              | 1.2
Specialized      | specialized.svg       | 0.85
Silca            | silca.svg             | 1.05
MET              | met.svg               | 1.68
Polymer Workshop | polymer.svg           | 1.3
GripGrab         | gripgrab-original.png | 1
DT Swiss         | dt-swiss.svg          | 0.85
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- comment -%} ===== Nothing below needs changing (except "red" -> "black", see above). ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign bc_n = 0 -%}
{%- capture bc_items -%}
{%- assign bc_lines = bc_brands | strip | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
{%- for bc_line in bc_lines -%}
  {%- assign bc_test = bc_line | strip -%}
  {%- if bc_test == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign bc_p = bc_line | split: '|' -%}
  {%- assign bc_name = bc_p[0] | strip -%}
  {%- assign bc_file = bc_p[1] | strip -%}
  {%- assign bc_size = bc_p[2] | strip | replace: ',', '.' | default: '1' -%}
  {%- assign bc_url = bc_file | file_url -%}
  {%- assign bc_n = bc_n | plus: 1 %}
  <li class="bc-brand"><span class="bc-logo" role="img" aria-label="{{ bc_name | escape }}" style="--scale: {{ bc_size }}; -webkit-mask-image: url('{{ bc_url }}'); mask-image: url('{{ bc_url }}')"><img src="{{ bc_url }}" alt="" decoding="async"></span></li>
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign bc_m2 = bc_n | modulo: 2 -%}{%- assign bc_s2 = 2 | minus: bc_m2 -%}
{%- assign bc_m4 = bc_n | modulo: 4 -%}{%- assign bc_s4 = 4 | minus: bc_m4 -%}
{%- assign bc_m6 = bc_n | modulo: 6 -%}{%- assign bc_s6 = 6 | minus: bc_m6 -%}
<ul class="bc-brands{% if bc_n >= 12 %} bc-brands--many{% endif %}" data-logos="red">
  {{- bc_items }}
  <li class="bc-brand bc-more" style="--bc-span-2: {{ bc_s2 }}; --bc-span-4: {{ bc_s4 }}; --bc-span-6: {{ bc_s6 }}"><p>…og mange flere</p></li>
</ul>
<style>
  .bc-brands {
    --bc-cols: 2; --bc-cell-h: 104px; --bc-cell-pad: 0.5rem; --bc-logo-h: 28px; --bc-logo-max: 85%;
    --bc-more-size: var(--secondary-heading-size, 1.563rem);
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--bc-cols), minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--gridline-width, 1px); background: rgb(var(--color-gridline, 255 191 191));
    list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;
    color: rgb(var(--color-scheme-text, 255 46 0));
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .bc-brands { --bc-cols: 4; --bc-cell-h: 120px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .bc-brands { --bc-cell-h: 160px; --bc-cell-pad: 1rem; --bc-logo-h: 36px; --bc-logo-max: 80%;
      --bc-more-size: var(--secondary-heading-size, 2.441rem); }
    .bc-brands--many { --bc-cell-h: 136px; --bc-logo-h: 32px; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1280px) { .bc-brands--many { --bc-cols: 6; } }
  .bc-brands *, .bc-brands *::before, .bc-brands *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .bc-brand {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 0; margin: 0;
    height: var(--bc-cell-h); padding: var(--bc-cell-pad); background: rgb(var(--color-scheme-background, 255 255 255));
  }
  /* The invisible <img> gives each logo its own shape; the mask paints it in the text colour. Never stretched. */
  .bc-logo {
    display: block; flex: 0 1 auto; min-width: 0; max-width: var(--bc-logo-max); background-color: currentColor;
    -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain; -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;
    -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;
  }
  .bc-logo img { display: block; width: auto; max-width: 100%; height: calc(var(--bc-logo-h) * var(--scale, 1)); opacity: 0; }
  .bc-brands[data-logos="black"] .bc-logo { background: none; -webkit-mask-image: none !important; mask-image: none !important; }
  .bc-brands[data-logos="black"] .bc-logo img { opacity: 1; object-fit: contain; filter: brightness(0); }
  @supports not ((-webkit-mask-image: none) or (mask-image: none)) {
    .bc-logo { background: none; }
    .bc-logo img { opacity: 1; object-fit: contain; filter: brightness(0); }
  }
  /* "…og mange flere" fills the rest of the last row */
  .bc-more { grid-column: span var(--bc-span-2); }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .bc-more { grid-column: span var(--bc-span-4); } }
  @media (min-width: 1280px) { .bc-brands--many .bc-more { grid-column: span var(--bc-span-6); } }
  .bc-more p {
    margin: 0; text-align: center; text-wrap: balance;
    font-family: var(--heading-font-stack, "Instrument Serif", serif); font-weight: var(--heading-font-weight, 400);
    font-size: var(--bc-more-size); line-height: var(--heading-line-height, 0.9); letter-spacing: var(--heading-letterspacing, -0.025em);
  }
</style>
